---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - Phinisi Network">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">Privacy Policy</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 font-['Inter'] leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-100 pb-6">Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you create an account, enroll in a course, or contact our customer support. This includes your name, email address, and profile data.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>The information we collect is used to operate our e-learning platform, process your course enrollments, send material updates, issue completion certificates, and improve our overall services.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">3. Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>We deeply respect your privacy. We <strong>do not sell</strong> or rent your personal information to third parties. We only share data with trusted service providers who help us operate (such as analytics and payment services) under strict confidentiality obligations.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">4. Security</h2>
            <p>We take reasonable technical and administrative measures to protect your personal information from loss, theft, and unauthorized access. However, please note that no internet transmission is 100% secure.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">5. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time. You can do this through your account settings or by contacting our support team directly.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
